Every synthetic SSN uses the \"999-\" prefix, a number range the real US Social Security Administration has never issued a deliberate, built-in privacy-by-design safeguard that flags the data as fake to anyone who checks.\n","- **Recommendation:** Use synthetic data (like Synthea) for early stage tol development and testing where no real clinical validation is needed yet; reserve real de-identified data for stages that genuinely require it, once full governance documentation and de-identification controls are in place.\n","- **Evidence produced:** Data profiling checks, governance scorecard, real-vs-synthetic comparison table"]}]}